STATUS OF THIS FILE

This file records that the project is internal. It is NOT an open-source
license grant and it does NOT resolve the third-party terms that apply to
material this project incorporates. Before any external release, an authorized
owner must select and apply an outbound license and must resolve every item
listed as unresolved in THIRD_PARTY.md. See that file for the specific
outstanding items.

The choice of outbound license is CONSTRAINED, not free. THIRD_PARTY.md
Section 0 records inbound terms that bind any externally released artifact:
in particular, 31.5% of the mid-train corpus comes from datasets whose license
requires that a use-based restriction be carried, as an enforceable provision,
in the terms governing any model trained on them. Read Section 0 before
drafting outbound terms, not after.

